; Template only. This dialplan does not answer the caller.
; Stasis owns answer, reject, and bridge. Do not add Answer() before Stasis.
; Point a dedicated DID at the Stasis application named in ASTERISK_APP_NAME.
; Personal-number forwarding is a later carrier or PBX route into the same context.

[ody-inbound]
exten => _X.,1,NoOp(ODY inbound ${CALLERID(num)})
 same => n,Stasis(ody-phone)
 same => n,Hangup()
